--- !u!114 &2745276345122853917
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4391118094115026273}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b031e8866e04b8441a56ee472768b03e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryDialogue
  dialogueText: {fileID: 6586650124464029358}
  dialogues:
  - "\u201CAlex, if you\u2019re receiving this transmission\u2026 then the situation
    is far worse than we expected.\u201D"
  - "\u201CThe Mothership has been discovered by the Dark Ones. They\u2019ve breached
    our outer defenses, seized control of several critical sectors, and are advancing
    toward the central command core.\u201D"
  - "\u201CWe\u2019ve lost contact with multiple combat squads. A few survivors are
    still holding out inside the engineering sectors, but they won\u2019t last much
    longer.\u201D"
  - "\u201CMost of the automated defense systems have been hacked and turned against
    us. If you want to get inside, you\u2019ll have to destroy the enemy patrol ships
    and clear a path to the main hangar.\u201D"
  - "\u201CAlex\u2026 this ship is humanity\u2019s last hope. If it falls, everything
    we fought for will disappear with it.\u201D"
  - "\u201CTake back the ship\u2026 and save whoever is still alive.\u201D"
  - "\u201CGood luck, soldier.\u201D"
